    "body": "I don't think it's quite the same as that. The vocabulary is HTML and there's an HTML and an XML syntax. This is true for SVG too. The vocabulary is SVG and there's an HTML and an XML syntax.\n\nGiving the vocabulary a different name in XML is rather weird and mostly a historical thing because it was new at the time and the focus back then was much more on syntax than systems.\n",
